// raw import
@sheet Data
@header | Metric | Value |
| A | 10 |

// gap comment
| B | 20 |
| C | 5 |

@sheet Summary
@header | Metric | Value |
| Total | =SUM(Data!Value) |
| Max | =MAX(Data!Value) |
| Min | =MIN(Data!Value) |

@sheet Audit
@header | Metric | Value |
| Spread | =Summary!B3-Summary!B4 |
| Recheck | =Summary!B2 |
